651	// =============================================================
652	// Screen-sheet render helpers — kept for FALLBACK cell-border wireframes
653	// when no headless browser is available for image rasterization (v8).
654	//
655	// v8 note: the PRIMARY path for Selection + ALV is now embedded PNG
656	// images produced by scripts/spec/screen-image-renderer.mjs. These
657	// helpers are still used for:
658	//   · Flow diagram rows (grey styled)
659	//   · BAPI mapping rows (grey styled)
660	//   · Yellow warning rows at the BOTTOM of the sheet (style 20)
